":[-15.3124716669181,216.43887461342175],"size":[446.61848675747433,428.51736388622646],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"text","localized_name":"text_in","name":"text_in","shape":7,"type":"STRING","link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"text","name":"text","type":"STRING","links":[286]}],"title":"4. The Prompt","properties":{"aux_id":"pixaroma/ComfyUI-Pixaroma","ver":"41e68d88a5b499d1e44333e41579c94b6d1cf895","Node name for S&R":"PixaromaPrompt","cnr_id":"ComfyUI-Pixaroma","promptState":{"text":"integrated_multimodal_description:\n[Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic fantasy music video style, medium shot. The East Asian woman shown in <Picture 1> maintains her facial identity, intricate silver hair crown with hanging ornaments, elegant sheer white layered robes, and elaborate pearl and jade-adorned necklace within the rugged, moonlit expanse of the Great Wall at night. She holds up an ancient-style paper lantern that casts a warm, flickering golden glow against her face, contrasting with the cool blue moonlight and misty atmosphere. The camera pushes in rapidly with small amplitude at fast speed as she glances serenely across the ancient battlements.\n[Shot 2] The shot cuts to a dynamic low-angle wide tracking shot. The woman walks rapidly along the weathered stone path of the Great Wall, flanked by dark, silhouetted watchtowers under a starry sky. She sweeps the golden lantern back and forth, casting rhythmic light across the worn brickwork and her trailing white silk robes. The camera trucks backward at fast speed while tilting up slightly to capture the majestic scale of the wall.\n[Shot 3] The camera cuts to a tight close-up over-the-shoulder shot. Soft, warm light pulses rhythmically from the lantern, illuminating the intricate silver ornaments on her head and the subtle blue forehead mark as she gazes into the dark, misty horizon. The thin, translucent fabric of her robe drifts softly in the night wind.\n[Shot 4] The shot transitions with a rapid whip pan to a Dutch-angle medium shot. The warm lantern light pierces through the swirling night fog, catching the sharp textures of the stone wall as she steps forward with grace. The camera rolls counterclockwise with small amplitude, emphasizing the mystical aura surrounding her.\n[Shot 5] The camera cuts to a high-angle overhead shot looking down at the winding structure of the Great Wall. Her lantern creates a moving pool of golden light against the dark, jagged silhouette of the structure, while she moves through the center, the moonlight outlining her ethereal figure as the camera pedestals down rapidly.\n[Shot 6] The shot cuts to a dramatic front-facing close-up shot. The woman turns toward the frame, raising the glowing lantern near her shoulder; the warm light illuminates her profile and the delicate pearls around her neck. Her gaze fixes on something distant in the night sky, settling into a striking, ethereal final pose.\noverall_soundscape: Soft, rhythmic swaying of the lantern, the distant hum of night wind against the stone wall, the rustle of layered silk robes, and the faint, melancholic melody of a bamboo flute carried by the breeze.\nnon_diegetic_music: Cinematic, orchestral fusion track featuring traditional Chinese instruments like the guzheng and erhu, layered over a deep, ambient synth bass and slow, pulsing percussion that intensifies with each camera cut.","order":"mine","sep":", ","accent":null,"showExpanded":false},"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.7","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[""],"color":"#14436c","bgcolor":"#2a2a2a"},{"id":247,"type":"PixaromaLoadAudio","pos":[-509.51259285471383,368.4973384696233],"size":[466.34611386654007,273.1287165596149],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"seconds","name":"seconds","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","link":298}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","links":[299,309]}],"title":"2. Upload Audio and adjust dur